WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:03.939
Kento Nanami’s life journey has been one
hell of a rollercoaster ride...

00:00:03.939 --> 00:00:08.059
From being an average Jujutsu Student who
watched his best friend pass away, to that

00:00:08.059 --> 00:00:12.220
of a depressed salaryman who had no meaning
at all in life, to finally one of the stronger

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:16.029
Sorcerers in Jujutsu Kaisen and someone who
drove me to create this channel.

00:00:16.029 --> 00:00:20.039
BUT let’s not forget that Nanami’s also
a complete badass, like the first time he

00:00:20.039 --> 00:00:25.180
showed up and went into overtime mode was
as someone who hated working overtime, pure

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:26.180
bliss!

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:32.390
Anyways, Kento Nanami is a grade one jujutsu
sorcerer who after 10 or 11 years as a salaryman

00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:36.510
quit his everyday job and returned to the
Jujutsu Academy to work with Gojo.

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:40.910
The reason that he left the academy in the
first place is that Nanami hated the lessons

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:44.370
that were being taught to him when it came
to accepting that they must throw away their

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:45.960
lives.

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:50.150
He felt that everyone held a value in this
world and that their lives were precious.

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:54.129
So naturally with Sorcerers being people who
put their lives on the line day in and day

00:00:54.129 --> 00:00:58.390
out for the safety of a civilian population,
who didnt even know what they did, it struck

00:00:58.390 --> 00:01:00.200
a cord within our man.

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:04.710
Especially after seeing the death of his closest
friend Yu, id say that was the final straw

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:07.520
that made him step down.

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:10.830
History/Background
So back in the past and as I slightly mentioned

00:01:10.830 --> 00:01:14.320
before, Nanami had once been a student at
Tokyo Jujutsu High.

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:18.659
During his first year in 2006, he found himself
working with Yu Haibara.

00:01:18.659 --> 00:01:23.750
Together, they joined the second years Suguru
and Gojo to help them on a mission in Okinawa,

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:27.410
more specifically as protection during the
erasure of Riko.

00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:34.030
After protecting the airport and I guess doing
some bodyguard work, it basically turned into

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:37.320
more of a summer vacation for them than a
mission.

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:42.119
After a year had passed, Nanami again teams
up with Yu for a more difficult mission where

00:01:42.119 --> 00:01:46.030
they were assigned to defeat a cursed spirit
which was believed to be grade 2.

00:01:46.030 --> 00:01:50.049
However, after arriving and discovering that
the Cursed Spirit wasnt a pathetic one and

00:01:50.049 --> 00:01:53.100
had become more powerful off the emotions
of nearby people.

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:57.820
It was revealed as a grade 1 cursed spirit
that was far too strong for Yu or Nanami to

00:01:57.820 --> 00:01:59.289
deal with.

00:01:59.289 --> 00:02:02.049
Sadly this ended up resulting in Yu Haibara’s
death!

00:02:02.049 --> 00:02:05.710
Nanami took Yu’s death differently from
everyone else as the duo had formed a close

00:02:05.710 --> 00:02:08.170
bond over their time together as first years.

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:13.900
Id say that Nanami’s views on being a jujutsu
sorcerer were warped in this moment and like

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:21.520
I previously mentioned it fully drove him
to disown Jujutsu Society.

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:35.300
Anyway, Nanami 

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:39.360
still did graduate from Jujutsu High, but
instantly decided to stop being a sorcerer

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:43.360
because he found it as a pain in the butt,
and had already had way too many traumatic

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:45.580
experiences through it.

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:53.450
So that pretty much brings us to today, back
in 2016 or 17 with Nanami re-joining Jujutsu

00:02:53.450 --> 00:02:55.550
society after taking away the bread girls
shoulder pain.

00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:59.879
Something that I absolutely love and didnt
realize until recently was what Nanami’s

00:02:59.879 --> 00:03:00.879
name means.

00:03:00.879 --> 00:03:04.920
So, Kento means “Cure for Depression”
and Nanami means “Building Man”.

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:09.920
First, it makes sense because the Kento part
of his name cured the darkness or depression

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:14.610
of the baker lady behind the counter by defeating
the cursed spirit hovering around her, and

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:17.180
he takes out depressing curses on a daily
basis.

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:21.980
On a second thought though, it totally doesn't,
NANAMI LOOKS MORE DEPRESSED THAN ANYONE!

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:25.319
"Building Man” is an interesting one.

00:03:25.319 --> 00:03:30.480
I think it probably portrays Nanami’s work-life,
we all know he worked like a dog, building

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:35.239
up his life, until he figured out that being
a salaryman or sorcerer still makes life feel

00:03:35.239 --> 00:03:37.269
like shit no matter what..

00:03:37.269 --> 00:03:42.519
A major turning point for Itadori occurs when
Kento Nanami is introduced to him by Gojo

00:03:42.519 --> 00:03:46.980
while on a mission to investigate the uncanny
deaths of three students at a theater.

00:03:46.980 --> 00:03:51.159
Gojo entrusted Nanami with Itadori’s training
on this mission but the two of them had different

00:03:51.159 --> 00:03:54.540
core values which made it hard for them to
initially get along.

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:58.519
After hearing his reasoning for joining Jujutsu
Society, Nanami doesn’t approve of teaching

00:03:58.519 --> 00:04:03.799
Yuji but can see that he wants to get stronger
so he decided to accompany him either way.

00:04:03.799 --> 00:04:09.640
Moving on to the movie theater case, Nanami
teaches Itadori to see the remnants of cursed

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:14.480
energy, and following those said remnants,
the duo comes across cursed spirits.

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:18.810
Throughout the battle, Nanami teaches Yuji
his techniques and showcases his skills in

00:04:18.810 --> 00:04:20.820
fighting the cursed spirit’s.

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:24.450
Just when Yuji got his cursed energy all fired
up and was about to finish off the cursed

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:28.729
spirit, Nanami stopped him and instead took
a photo of the curse.

00:04:28.729 --> 00:04:32.460
Confused over what he was doing, as typically
curses wont show up in photo’s.

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:37.930
Nanami revealed to Yuji that sadly he wasn't
actually fighting curses, but instead transfigured

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:39.000
humans.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:43.370
Taking this in shatters Yuji’s morals and
causes him to not feel good about the quickly

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:48.570
evolving situation, but Nanami along with
Shoko on the phone explains that it’s okay

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:50.790
to kill the transfigured humans.

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:55.250
This is pretty much because they’re already
brain dead.

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:59.610
Shoko also explains to Itadori that he wasn't
the one to kill the the transfigured humans

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:03.960
as they had initially died of shock when their
bodies were being modified.

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:08.880
Yuji still cant get over it and reveals that
the death of two transfigured humans he killed

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:11.229
earlier weighed on him heavily.

00:05:11.229 --> 00:05:16.010
Seeing Yuji get angry on the behalf of modified
humans, Nanami realized that Yuji can truly

00:05:16.010 --> 00:05:19.470
feel empathy for others and take their emotions
on board.

00:05:19.470 --> 00:05:24.470
So to snap him out of the downward spiral
he was in, and get Yuji to use those emotions

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:28.950
in combination with his cursed energy, Nanami
explained that it was time to go all-out and

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:30.330
fight the other spirits.

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:34.710
Over in the highschool office now, Nanami
shows a map to Yuji on which he pinned the

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:39.090
locations where unnatural deaths took place,
in an attempt triangulate them and find out

00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:40.710
the culprit’s hideout.

00:05:40.710 --> 00:05:44.830
Nanami also assigns Itadori to investigate
Junpei to find out more about the theater

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:47.199
case since he was present there.

00:05:47.199 --> 00:05:52.630
Itadori gets busy with his own investigation
regarding Junpei and so does Nanami.

00:05:52.630 --> 00:05:57.650
While Yuji is off doing his thing with Junpei,
Nanami goes to the sewers and forces Mahito

00:05:57.650 --> 00:06:00.660
to leave the dank environment he calls his
place of residence.

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:06.539
Nanami and Mahito’s rivalry begins in the
sewers when Nanami, being punctual, promises

00:06:06.539 --> 00:06:10.639
to defeat Mahito quickly as he doesn’t like
to work overtime.

00:06:10.639 --> 00:06:15.300
Mahito mocks Nanami by calling him weak and
so the battle begins!

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:19.181
Nanami slashes Mahito with his cursed tool
and manages to break his arm off but it’s

00:06:19.181 --> 00:06:24.520
in vain since Mahito, through his Idle Transfiguration
technique, heals his arm and wounds.

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:29.150
Mahito also shows “his collection” of
human stockpiles while explaining how he makes

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:33.750
contact with the human soul and alters their
body shape.

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:38.490
Nanami doesn’t want to waste any time and
has to get off work at 6 PM so he decides

00:06:38.490 --> 00:06:40.930
to end the battle as quickly as possible.

00:06:40.930 --> 00:06:45.670
Mahito tries his best to tire Nanami out but
you know it’s O-V-E-R when Nanami loosens

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:50.020
his tie and knots it around his hand in preparation
to go overtime mode!!

00:06:50.020 --> 00:06:56.139
Yolked up, Nanami explains his 7:3 ratio technique
which creates a weak point at a specific location

00:06:56.139 --> 00:06:58.490
and automatically tracks his strike to it.

00:06:58.490 --> 00:07:02.800
He also reveals that he can create this line
along more than just their full height or

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:06.460
wingspan and designate it along various body
parts.

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:10.110
For instance, the head, upper arm, forearm,
and so on.

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:14.780
Also on top of that, Nanami’s cursed technique
can affect more than just living creatures.

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:18.470
As the battle continues, it was pretty evident
that there were two ways in which Nanami could

00:07:18.470 --> 00:07:23.889
defeat Mahito, one way is to exorcize Mahito
while the other way is to reduce him to smithereens

00:07:23.889 --> 00:07:25.720
with a single blow.

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:31.229
Instead though, Nanami creates his 7 ratio
3 line on his opponent’s surroundings and

00:07:31.229 --> 00:07:34.160
also cuts Mahito’s leg off.

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:38.650
With Mahito unable to move, Nanami bids farewell
to his opponent as a mountain of bounders

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:41.860
quickly pound the patch face curse into the
floor.

00:07:41.860 --> 00:07:45.860
And just like that, my man pushed a currently
Semi-Special Grade cursed spirit to the brink

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:47.319
of death, kinda!

00:07:47.319 --> 00:07:52.610
I only say semi right now cause mans still
growing, BUT as we all know, Mahito escapes.

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:56.270
After Mahito escaped, of course, he did the
most despicable thing he could think of and

00:07:56.270 --> 00:08:00.000
manipulated Junpei which leads us to the next
moment Nanami appears.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:05.000
So remember the highschool and Mahito along
with Sukuna laughing their asses off over

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:09.000
Yuji’s mental breakdown, well just after
that Yuji and as Mahito was about to deal

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:14.509
the killing blow, Nanami arrived just in time
to save Yuji.

00:08:14.509 --> 00:08:18.940
The grade 1 sorcerer decides to scold the
student for ignoring orders later and asks

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:20.690
for a status update.

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:26.340
Yuji reveals that he was unable to save Junpei
or his mother from the curses.

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:30.530
Nanami notices how Yuji is always thinking
of others before himself and decides to ask

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:32.990
about Yuji's individual status.

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:38.020
Always resilient, and despite being stabbed
several times by Mahito, Yuji insists that

00:08:38.020 --> 00:08:39.419
he's fine.

00:08:39.419 --> 00:08:43.919
Noticing the salaryman, Mahito expresses his
joy in reuniting with Nanami.

00:08:43.919 --> 00:08:48.110
Looking at the curse, Nanami see’s that
his nose is bleeding and comes to the conclusion

00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:50.480
that Yuji is able to harm Mahito.

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:55.200
He also quickly realizes that if this is the
case, there must be a reason as to why Mahito

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:57.010
cant currently kill Yuji.

00:08:57.010 --> 00:09:01.420
In order to take advantage of this, Nanami
develops a strategy to use his cursed technique

00:09:01.420 --> 00:09:05.660
to stifle Mahito's movements while relentlessly
attacking with Yuji, who can eventually land

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:06.950
a killing blow.

00:09:06.950 --> 00:09:11.200
The duo prepares for the fight and Nanami
declares that they must exorcise Mahito here

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:13.010
and now.

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:17.260
Mahito prepares himself by creating an eyeball
on his left palm while morphing his other

00:09:17.260 --> 00:09:18.830
arm into a bladed shape.

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:23.310
He plans on using the eye to watch Yuji while
focusing on killing Nanami first.

00:09:23.310 --> 00:09:27.220
Mahito engages both sorcerers, with Yuji on
his left and Nanami on his right.

00:09:27.220 --> 00:09:31.800
Nanami rapidly deflects Mahito's bladed arm
while Yuji goes for a low kick.

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:35.810
Thanks to the eye on Mahito's hand, he's able
to jump above Yuji's kick while sword fighting

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:37.560
with Nanami at the same time.

00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:42.680
While in the air, Mahito transforms his entire
body in a sphere of extending spikes.

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:47.130
The sorcerers are able to evade and parry
this to break the spikes apart, making Mahito

00:09:47.130 --> 00:09:49.370
immediately regret using this type of attack.

00:09:49.370 --> 00:09:53.640
After breaking apart all the spikes, Yuji
and Nanami prepare to deal a massive combined

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:54.640
blow.

00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:59.329
However, Mahito is able to evade by transforming
his body into a child-like version of himself

00:09:59.329 --> 00:10:01.600
and slips between his opponents.

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:05.540
Having watched this, both Nanami and Yuji
are able to notice that Mahito stores up his

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:08.430
cursed energy just before transforming.

00:10:08.430 --> 00:10:12.580
Knowing that one hit from Yuji could kill
him in this smaller form, Mahito changes back

00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:15.460
to normal and spews out several small transfigured
humans.

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:19.630
Then using idle transfiguration he creates
several mutated corpses that are ordered to

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:21.060
kill Yuji.

00:10:21.060 --> 00:10:24.959
Knowing how mentally incapable Yuji currently
is when it comes to taking a life, Nanami

00:10:24.959 --> 00:10:29.370
tries to intercept the transfigured children,
but Mahito who seizes the opening, nearly

00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:31.380
takes his head off with his bladed arm.

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:35.670
Seeing it coming, Nanami uses his superior
reflexes and ducks under the blade at the

00:10:35.670 --> 00:10:36.900
last second.

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:41.380
With no where to go now, Mahito transforms
his arm into a much larger mutation and pins

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:45.480
Nanami to the wall of a nearby building while
claiming that Yuji won't be able to kill the

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:47.200
mutated humans.

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:51.310
At the same time, Yuji escapes to the roof
and tries to pin down one of the transfigured

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:53.040
humans to avoid fighting.

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:56.540
Hearing the groggy voice of the curse try
and ask for their lives to be ended, their

00:10:56.540 --> 00:11:00.360
words horrify Yuji who’s left unable to
do anything.

00:11:00.360 --> 00:11:07.210
Mahito plans on having Yuji fight a transfigured
Nanami next and boasts that Yuji is a fool

00:11:07.210 --> 00:11:10.960
for not being able to distinguish expectations
from reality.

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:14.990
Nanami who knows that Yuji will eventually
be able to grapple with the idea of fighting

00:11:14.990 --> 00:11:20.200
transfigured humans, calmly replies that Mahito
is the fool and Yuji is making that distinction

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:22.190
at this very moment.

00:11:22.190 --> 00:11:27.959
Right on cue, Yuji, our boy, jumps down from
the roof and smashes down on Mahito's enlarged

00:11:27.959 --> 00:11:29.800
arm, freeing Nanami.

00:11:29.800 --> 00:11:33.579
Knowing what was done, Mahito is satisfied
to know that managed to kill the transfigured

00:11:33.579 --> 00:11:38.510
humans, but Yuji, who cant yet bring himself
to understand the reasoning for all this bloodshed,

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:39.700
is furious.

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:43.860
Suddenly, Big Nanami appears behind Mahito,
ready to strike with his blunt sword.

00:11:43.860 --> 00:11:48.320
In a fraction of a second, the cursed spirit
instantly reacts, confident he can counter

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:49.910
Nanami's cursed technique.

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:54.370
However, Yuji cracks him hard with a strong
right hook, allowing Nanami to follows up

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:58.959
by creating a weak point in Mahito's face
and smashing it with his blunt sword.

00:11:58.959 --> 00:12:04.019
The teacher and student lay the absolute fug
out of Mahito until all of a sudden the curse

00:12:04.019 --> 00:12:06.080
can feel death approaching.

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:10.680
Using that impending doom to inspire the powers
within the depths of his soul, Mahito conjures

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:16.400
for the very first time, his own Domain Expansion:
The Self-Embodiment of Perfection.

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:21.149
With no escape for the intended target, it
immediately locks Yuji out and traps Nanami

00:12:21.149 --> 00:12:25.279
alone inside a void filled with Mahito's soul
transfiguring hands.

00:12:25.279 --> 00:12:30.170
Being a grade 1 sorcerer, Nanami is strong
enough to fight against and even beat special

00:12:30.170 --> 00:12:35.140
grade curses, because of that and due to the
knowledge he posses on how a domain works,

00:12:35.140 --> 00:12:39.649
Nanami immediately realizes how bad of a situation
this currently is.

00:12:39.649 --> 00:12:44.350
Happy with himself as per usual, Mahito expresses
his gratitude for the sorcerer helping him

00:12:44.350 --> 00:12:47.850
attain this greater level of strength.

00:12:47.850 --> 00:12:51.949
Frustrated that Nanami was the only one locked
inside, Yuji rappidly bangs on the outside

00:12:51.949 --> 00:12:55.769
of the Domain Expansion with his cursed energy
infused fists.

00:12:55.769 --> 00:13:00.149
Inside and understanding the crap he’s in,
Nanami knows he's literally in the palm of

00:13:00.149 --> 00:13:01.930
Mahito's hands now.

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:05.540
After looking back on the recent choices he
made in regards to quitting his salaryman

00:13:05.540 --> 00:13:11.370
life and re-joining Jujutsu High, Nanami accepts
his fate and tells Mahito to save his gratitude

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:13.890
since he has plenty already.

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:18.220
Taking off his shades, Nanami proudly admits
that he has no regrets.

00:13:18.220 --> 00:13:22.560
Suddenly and before Mahito can activate the
sure hit effect of a Domain Expansion, Yuji

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:25.779
breaks into the Domain, by shattering it from
the outside.

00:13:25.779 --> 00:13:31.040
This feat btw isnt actually that crazy, a
domains purpose is entrapment, so breaking

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:35.829
on from the outside is something that works
as in theory it should be extremely weak there.

00:13:35.829 --> 00:13:41.010
Obviously cause our boy has the demon king
inside of him, this forces Mahito to touch

00:13:41.010 --> 00:13:43.790
Yuji's soul, once again angering Sukuna.

00:13:43.790 --> 00:13:49.350
Due to the previous meeting, the King of Curses
reminds Mahito that there wouldn't be a second

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:53.390
warning, and slashes his body with two devastatingly
deep cuts.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:59.300
This in turn severely damages Mahito and destroys
the rest of his domain, dropping him to his

00:13:59.300 --> 00:14:00.300
knees, defeated.

00:14:00.300 --> 00:14:03.900
Several things instantly run through Yuji's
head leading to the decision that he needs

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:05.970
to act quickly and finish off Mahito.

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:11.130
Feeling knackered, Mahito admits that Domain
Expansion has drained most of his cursed energy

00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:14.470
and decides to use what he has left to expand
his body.

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:18.710
Seeing the enlarged balloon of a curse, Yuji
believes that Mahito is weak and unable to

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:23.920
counterattack, so with nothing holding him
back, he filled his fist with a pulse of intent

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:27.060
and strikes Mahito's enlarged body with Divergent
Fist!

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:32.160
However instead of destroying the curse, the
body pops like a balloon and Mahito's real

00:14:32.160 --> 00:14:35.050
weakened body escapes back into the sewers.

00:14:35.050 --> 00:14:39.279
Seeing it shoot out, Nanami attempts to stop
him by destroying the entrance, but Mahito

00:14:39.279 --> 00:14:40.600
manages to scurry away.

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:53.760
That there brings everything inside of the
Mahito Arc with Nanami to an end, he does

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:59.190
briefly make an entrance during the Kyoto
Goodwin Even Arc, but its only to update Gojo

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:03.820
about what happened previously with him and
Yuji at Satozakura high school.

00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:08.410
The next time we get to see the big man himself
is during the Shibuya Incident Arc where while

00:15:08.410 --> 00:15:14.220
with Megumi and Takuma, the three are informed
of the situation currently going on in Shibuya.

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:19.300
Later, when the citizens get attacked by mutated
humans, Nanami along with Ino and Megumi head

00:15:19.300 --> 00:15:21.220
over in order to protect them.

00:15:21.220 --> 00:15:26.240
Nanami strategizes and divides the group up
as he wants them to reach Itadori's location.

00:15:26.240 --> 00:15:31.860
Once they reach Yuji's location, the mini
Mechamaru explains what had happened to them

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:35.880
against Mahito and what the best course of
action for the upcoming night should be.

00:15:35.880 --> 00:15:39.509
Nanami agrees with Kokichi's plans and says
that they will first need to lift the screen

00:15:39.509 --> 00:15:40.509
around Shibuya.

00:15:40.509 --> 00:15:44.639
He also says that instead of staying with
the younger sorcerers, he will go meet up

00:15:44.639 --> 00:15:58.449
with Kiyotaka whilst Megumi, Yuji, and Takuma
deal with 

00:15:58.449 --> 00:16:00.089
the curtain.

00:16:00.089 --> 00:16:04.060
Nanami for the time being puts the professional
sorcerer Takuma in charge and lets them know

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:08.699
that if they bump into Naobito and Kusakabe
they should explain the situation, before

00:16:08.699 --> 00:16:10.449
leaving himself.

00:16:10.449 --> 00:16:15.980
After journeying through Shibuya, Nanami finds
one of his best friends Kiyotaka lying wounded

00:16:15.980 --> 00:16:17.380
on the ground.

00:16:17.380 --> 00:16:21.589
Seeing his injuries literally pushes Nanami
to the limit as it reminds him of how he lost

00:16:21.589 --> 00:16:23.339
Yu in the past.

00:16:23.339 --> 00:16:27.610
Getting furious for his friend, Nanami for
the first time in the series throws away any

00:16:27.610 --> 00:16:32.339
thought of holding back and angrily headed
out in search of whoever did this.

00:16:32.339 --> 00:16:37.980
NOW HE’S SERIOUSLY PISSED OFF and OML I
love this part of the series, plus Mappa came

00:16:37.980 --> 00:16:39.560
through so freaking clutch.

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:45.350
As someone who’s whole reason for even starting
Jujutsu Kaisen, was Nanami, the adaptation

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:48.529
of this section of the manga by Mappa is unreal.

00:16:48.529 --> 00:16:54.250
Like I had to re-wind this next part 18,000
times to take in this new kind of feeling.

00:16:54.250 --> 00:17:03.320
Like Id never seen my dad on the big screen
before, but on that day, there he stood.

00:17:03.320 --> 00:17:09.059
Having come across Nobara in her moment of
need.

00:17:09.059 --> 00:17:13.959
Nanami with a conviction that would make the
earth shake, appears at the end of the corridor.

00:17:13.959 --> 00:17:24.610
Haruta the freak, like for a villan this dude
is fantastic and I love his messed up demeanor,

00:17:24.610 --> 00:17:32.410
but unluckily for him, he was unable to say
anything as he was figuring out if he was

00:17:32.410 --> 00:17:34.890
allowed to attack non black suits.

00:17:34.890 --> 00:17:39.309
Speaking up, Shigemo tells the newcomer to
read the room and claims to have a hostage

00:17:39.309 --> 00:17:41.190
so he shouldnt attack.

00:17:41.190 --> 00:17:46.270
To his bewilderment though, Akari crawls up
the escalator to escape from the curse user.

00:17:46.270 --> 00:17:51.170
While Shigemo laments about her getting away,
Nanami appears behind him.

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:54.500
Nanami asks where and how many enemies there
are.

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:58.950
Shigemo replies that he doesn't know and turns
around, upward slashing Nanami's shoulder

00:17:58.950 --> 00:18:00.010
at the same time.

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:05.559
He tries to follow up with a front kick, but
it's as if he hits a mountain of stone.

00:18:05.559 --> 00:18:11.430
Looking up at the sorcerer, Shigemo is confused
since Nanami doesn't budge and he isn't cut

00:18:11.430 --> 00:18:12.430
either.

00:18:12.430 --> 00:18:16.520
Annoyed, Nanami asks the curse user the same
question again.

00:18:16.520 --> 00:18:21.409
Haruta begins to say he doesn't know but Nanami
doesn't even let the dude fully answer before

00:18:21.409 --> 00:18:23.100
activating his Ratio Technique.

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:27.789
In an instant, he creates a weak point on
Shigemo's shit eating face and backhands the

00:18:27.789 --> 00:18:29.610
child without a second thought.

00:18:29.610 --> 00:18:33.910
The impact blows Shigemo tumbling through
the air, destroying anything his way and launching

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:36.890
him across the room into a wall behind Nobara.

00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:42.360
Not really knowing much about Nanami, Nobara
is surprised by how ridiculously strong and

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:45.720
overpowered he is in comparison to Shigemo.

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:49.780
Standing up as blood pours from his mouth,
Shigemo believes he'd be dead without his

00:18:49.780 --> 00:18:51.260
cursed technique.

00:18:51.260 --> 00:18:57.060
Feeling the difference in strength, Shigemo
knows he needs to run but before he can move,

00:18:57.060 --> 00:19:01.250
Nanami grabs him by his hair and delivers
a ferocious body blow that slams Shigemo into

00:19:01.250 --> 00:19:04.539
the wall, shattering a small part of it from
the impact.

00:19:04.539 --> 00:19:09.159
Coughing up even more violently now, Shigemo
communicates with his cursed tool, which levitates

00:19:09.159 --> 00:19:12.270
up into the air and attempts to stab Nanami
from behind.

00:19:12.270 --> 00:19:16.230
Catching sight of it, Nobara sends one of
her nails into the hand of the cursed tool,

00:19:16.230 --> 00:19:18.030
pinning it to the wall.

00:19:18.030 --> 00:19:22.571
Shigemo tells her not to interfere but Nanami
grabs him by the throat with his left hand

00:19:22.571 --> 00:19:26.930
and begins raising his right hand while filling
full of cursed energy.

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:31.820
Asking the same question once more, Nanami
reveals that he came across several dead assistant

00:19:31.820 --> 00:19:33.539
managers on the way here.

00:19:33.539 --> 00:19:37.230
He asks the curse user if he was responsible.

00:19:37.230 --> 00:19:44.049
Fearful for his life, Shigemo tears up and
apologizes, but it's far too late for that.

00:19:44.049 --> 00:19:48.460
Having lifted him up by the throat, Nanami
drops his dumb ass and hits him with one final

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:54.980
blow enhanced by the Ratio Technique, AND
OLORD, MY BOY FLIPS AND SPINS LIKE NO TOMORROW,

00:19:54.980 --> 00:19:59.690
NANAMI LEGIT BEYBLADE STYLE LET IT RIP ON
HIS ASS AND SENT HIM THROUGH FREAKING EVERYTHING!

00:19:59.690 --> 00:20:04.640
The dude rocketed through a wall outside into
another wall of a building across the street.

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:10.380
As the dust settled, Shigemo was left unconscious
sitting in the crater created by the impact,

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:13.549
with blood profusely pouring from his face.

00:20:13.549 --> 00:20:18.450
This here I think for the first time in the
series, makes Nobara realize that Nanami is

00:20:18.450 --> 00:20:22.150
on another level, and this is what it means
to be a true grade 1 sorcerer.

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:27.530
I feel like before this moment she was never
there to witness those crazy feats, like Gojo

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:33.280
destroying Hanami in the goodwill arc or anything
to do with the vs Mahito arc.

00:20:33.280 --> 00:20:38.809
But here she was witness to what a true Grade
1 sorcerer is made of and what she’ll need

00:20:38.809 --> 00:20:43.659
to achieve in the future.

00:20:43.659 --> 00:20:49.390
After this, Nanami explains Gojo’s situation
to her and Arata and says he’ll be off to

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:50.580
save him.

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:56.539
Nobara wants to help as well but Nanami explains
that this fight is for grade 1 sorcerers so

00:20:56.539 --> 00:20:58.600
she should back down.

00:20:58.600 --> 00:21:12.610
I was 

00:21:12.610 --> 00:21:18.669
truly happy Nanami was given a moment like
this, before the next stuff that happens.

00:21:18.669 --> 00:21:22.260
Without it I’d feel like a lot of people
might’ve started to think he an overhyped

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:30.030
teacher, that grade 1 sorcerers weren't all
that impressive and the scaling method in

00:21:30.030 --> 00:21:33.580
Jujutsu Kaisen was useless.

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:39.520
With this though, it shows just how large
of a gap there is between each grade of sorcery.

00:21:39.520 --> 00:21:45.310
From Nobara at grade 3 to getting dominated
by Shigemo who’s a grade 2 (I think) and

00:21:45.310 --> 00:21:48.549
finally the G himself rolling in as a grade
1.

00:21:48.549 --> 00:21:52.730
It gives the power system credence and shows
us that sometimes, it doesn't matter what

00:21:52.730 --> 00:21:58.240
the technique is, there may just be an overwhelmingly
stronger force that you wont be able to stop.

00:21:58.240 --> 00:22:02.860
Either way enough of me rambling absolute
nonsense.

00:22:02.860 --> 00:22:08.230
After leaving the girls, Nanami, Naobito,
and Maki come across Dagon, one of the special-grade

00:22:08.230 --> 00:22:24.809
cursed spirits.

00:22:24.809 --> 00:22:29.720
As the fight starts, Nanami watches Naobito
attacking Dagon and struggling a bit so he

00:22:29.720 --> 00:22:32.429
steps in to attack with his own Ration Technique.

00:22:32.429 --> 00:22:36.580
He strikes down with his blunt sword on Dagon,
which the curse comfortably blocks with his

00:22:36.580 --> 00:22:37.580
forearm.

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:41.110
A second later though and having found the
weak point, Nanami's cursed technique takes

00:22:41.110 --> 00:22:44.680
effect, sending Dagon crashing back to the
ground.

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:48.309
Watching the other two sorcerers fighting
Dagon, Nanami dives down on top of the curse

00:22:48.309 --> 00:22:51.440
and strike’s him through the frame Naobito
had just stuck him inside.

00:22:51.440 --> 00:22:56.020
Instead of getting hit like last time, Dagon
blocks Nanami's sword with a shield of water,

00:22:56.020 --> 00:22:58.980
repelling the critical hit and frustrating
Nanami.

00:22:58.980 --> 00:23:03.929
With the curse walking forth, a cylinder-shaped
water shield flows in a circle in the air

00:23:03.929 --> 00:23:06.049
around Dagon to protect him.

00:23:06.049 --> 00:23:10.159
Watching it, Nanami feels like they haven't
done any damage due to the curse's boundless

00:23:10.159 --> 00:23:11.179
health.

00:23:11.179 --> 00:23:15.700
The sorcerers ready their fighting stances
as Naobito asks what their best course of

00:23:15.700 --> 00:23:16.820
action is.

00:23:16.820 --> 00:23:21.200
Then they all strike in unison as the old
man reveals that their best way to counter

00:23:21.200 --> 00:23:25.630
is to simply overwhelm their adversary before
he can activate any techniques.

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:30.020
The three jujutsu sorcerers all rapidly attack
Dagon's water shield at the same time, threatening

00:23:30.020 --> 00:23:31.789
to crush him with pure speed.

00:23:31.789 --> 00:23:35.559
As they progress, the sorcerers start slowly
piercing the water shield.

00:23:35.559 --> 00:23:38.370
Naobito's fist manages to get through first,
surprising Dagon.

00:23:38.370 --> 00:23:42.539
He decides to weave a hand sign detonating
the shield into a massive explosion of water

00:23:42.539 --> 00:23:44.640
that forces Nanami and Maki back.

00:23:44.640 --> 00:23:50.029
In Naobito’s side of the bout, Dagon attempted
to use another hand sign but Naobito tells

00:23:50.029 --> 00:23:51.840
him not to even think about it.

00:23:51.840 --> 00:23:55.770
Instantly he pummels Dagon's mid-section as
well as his hands with a flurry of downward

00:23:55.770 --> 00:24:00.210
punches, destroying his fingers, making it
impossible to cast hand signs.

00:24:00.210 --> 00:24:05.620
However, it turns out to be a simple distraction
as a symbol appears on Dagon's stomach, signaling

00:24:05.620 --> 00:24:08.370
the activation of his Domain Expansion.

00:24:08.370 --> 00:24:13.270
This traps Naobito in Dagon's coastal domain:
Horizon of the Captivating Skandha.

00:24:13.270 --> 00:24:19.050
Ofcourse Nanami’s also trapped inside, along
with Maki who’re both assaulted by piranha-like

00:24:19.050 --> 00:24:20.179
shikigami.

00:24:20.179 --> 00:24:24.409
The crazy thing about these fish is that they
don't exist until they hit the target due

00:24:24.409 --> 00:24:30.910
to the effect of the domain's sure hit effect..

00:24:30.910 --> 00:24:37.450
Dagon decides to focus seventy percent of
his power on Naobito and the remaining thirty

00:24:37.450 --> 00:24:38.690
percent on Nanami.

00:24:38.690 --> 00:24:44.429
He activates Technique Release: Death Swarm,
summoning a literal death swarm of fish shikigami

00:24:44.429 --> 00:24:45.640
to his side.

00:24:45.640 --> 00:24:50.330
Anticipating the attack, Nanami warns Maki
to attack without hesitation, because if she

00:24:50.330 --> 00:24:53.669
doesn't, the shikigami will instantly eat
them alive.

00:24:53.669 --> 00:24:57.929
Sadly for our girl, his advice is interrupted
when the shikigami attack Nanami first and

00:24:57.929 --> 00:25:00.630
appear to devour his upper body.

00:25:00.630 --> 00:25:04.669
Skipping slightly forth and after the goat,
Megumi makes his appearance by using his Domain

00:25:04.669 --> 00:25:09.419
Expansion to enter from the outside, Dagon
calls Megumi a fool for entering voluntarily

00:25:09.419 --> 00:25:11.500
and motions to attack him.

00:25:11.500 --> 00:25:15.909
Having gained the playful cloud, the special
grade weapon with no specific technique from

00:25:15.909 --> 00:25:19.590
Megumi’s endless well, Maki stops him by
attacking from behind.

00:25:19.590 --> 00:25:24.090
The strike lands, cutting away a good chunk
of Dagon's arm and surprising him with the

00:25:24.090 --> 00:25:25.700
force of the impact.

00:25:25.700 --> 00:25:30.980
Maki whirls around and uses the momentum of
her spin for a powerful follow-up attack strong

00:25:30.980 --> 00:25:34.190
enough to send the special grade skidding
across his own water.

00:25:34.190 --> 00:25:38.110
As Dagon recovers from the heavy blows, he
realizes that his guaranteed hit has been

00:25:38.110 --> 00:25:40.230
nullified because of Megumi's domain.

00:25:40.230 --> 00:25:44.679
To restore Death Swarm Dagon ignores Maki
and focuses on crushing Megumi.

00:25:44.679 --> 00:25:49.890
Due to how Megumi is stuck in a domain struggle,
Dagon believes killing Megumi will be simple

00:25:49.890 --> 00:25:52.870
and spawns two eel-like shikigami from his
body to attack.

00:25:52.870 --> 00:25:58.290
In that moment, the actual rock of a human
makes his re-appearance having survived Death

00:25:58.290 --> 00:26:01.200
Swarm for an entire minute and protects Megumi.

00:26:01.200 --> 00:26:05.510
Standing next to the first year now, he asks
where Yuji and Ino are and Megumi explains

00:26:05.510 --> 00:26:07.429
what happened to each of them.

00:26:07.429 --> 00:26:11.740
Grappling with what to do next, Nanami tells
Megumi to focus on his domain while the others

00:26:11.740 --> 00:26:12.799
protect him.

00:26:12.799 --> 00:26:17.640
Dagon who’s actually baffled with how Nanami
survived Death Swarm from an entire minute

00:26:17.640 --> 00:26:24.520
is taken offguard, when Naobito throws a fierce
left hook but Dagon ducks under it.

00:26:24.520 --> 00:26:28.890
He's shocked that Naobito aswell managed to
survive Death Swarm's onslaught.

00:26:28.890 --> 00:26:34.730
Trying to overwhelm him now, Maki comes up
behind Dagon and ready's her weapon while

00:26:34.730 --> 00:26:38.580
simultaneously Dagon blocks a flying knee
from the old man.

00:26:38.580 --> 00:26:43.059
Before Playful Cloud hits, Dagon summons two
large shikigami from his body to repel the

00:26:43.059 --> 00:26:44.059
sorcerers.

00:26:44.059 --> 00:26:48.250
The shikigami initially pushes Naobito across
the sand but the grade 1 sorcerer traps it

00:26:48.250 --> 00:26:51.640
inside a frame and crushes it with a powerful
stomp.

00:26:51.640 --> 00:26:56.191
Behind Naobito, more shikigami head toward
Megumi but Nanami stops them with his Ratio

00:26:56.191 --> 00:26:58.899
Technique, slashing them apart with ease.

00:26:58.899 --> 00:27:03.200
He believes that they might win if they can
keep up this momentum, but as blood begins

00:27:03.200 --> 00:27:08.049
to drip from Megumi’s nose, its evident
he’s reaching his limit.

00:27:08.049 --> 00:27:12.700
Surprising Nanami, Megumi reveals that he's
not actually in the midst of a domain battle.

00:27:12.700 --> 00:27:16.809
He's trying to open a hole in the barrier
so they can escape rather than enforcing his

00:27:16.809 --> 00:27:17.809
own expansion.

00:27:17.809 --> 00:27:22.950
In his eyes, Dagon likely can't use domain
expansion again so if the sorcerers can escape,

00:27:22.950 --> 00:27:24.980
then they can win.

00:27:24.980 --> 00:27:30.830
Due to how he entered, Megumi is sure the
barrier's edge is right below.

00:27:30.830 --> 00:27:35.510
Nanami tells him that he better not be planning
to stay behind himself, to which Megumi affirms

00:27:35.510 --> 00:27:38.100
that he doesn't plan on throwing his life
away.

00:27:38.100 --> 00:27:39.880
Not just yet anyway haha.

00:27:39.880 --> 00:27:41.419
Watch this if you wanna know what I mean.

00:27:41.419 --> 00:27:43.620
(Mahoraga video Sukuna vs Mahoraga)

00:27:43.620 --> 00:27:47.800
Nanami calls out to his allies, asking Maki
and Naobito to assemble.

00:27:47.800 --> 00:27:53.929
He does so in a roundabout way, but the Zenin
Team trusts Nanami and heads toward Megumi.

00:27:53.929 --> 00:27:58.799
Confused, Dagon wonders why they would get
in a group and make it easier for him to attack.

00:27:58.799 --> 00:28:03.409
It takes a moment, but he quickly realizes
Megumi's plan and panics, rushing to follow

00:28:03.409 --> 00:28:05.620
them a step too late.

00:28:05.620 --> 00:28:10.000
Nanami sees that Dagon's figured it out but
believes it's too late for him to stop them

00:28:10.000 --> 00:28:11.000
now.

00:28:11.000 --> 00:28:15.419
On cue, Megumi opens the hole and everyone
readies themselves to leave the domain, but

00:28:15.419 --> 00:28:18.779
suddenly an unsuspecting intruder enters through
it.

00:28:18.779 --> 00:28:23.970
The recently resurrected Toji Fushiguro uses
the opportunity to climb through the hole

00:28:23.970 --> 00:28:28.519
into the domain, forcing everyone there to
bear witness to the flesh of the one who is

00:28:28.519 --> 00:28:32.510
free and all his overwhelming intensity.

00:28:32.510 --> 00:28:46.039
So im skipping over everything that happens
with Toji because well Nanami doesn't really

00:28:46.039 --> 00:28:48.580
have anything to do with what's about to happen.

00:28:48.580 --> 00:28:52.399
Like im pretty sure he might only asks who’s
side he’s on, but thats about in from here

00:28:52.399 --> 00:28:53.460
until the end of the Toji vs Dagon beatdown.

00:28:53.460 --> 00:28:57.920
After merking the Fish, Toji, the puppet of
carnage, drags Megumi off to deal with his

00:28:57.920 --> 00:29:00.700
son for the first time in his life.

00:29:00.700 --> 00:29:04.760
Instantly after, Jogo who’s shown up on
the block launches a surprise attack on the

00:29:04.760 --> 00:29:07.269
already injured three remaining sorcerers.

00:29:07.269 --> 00:29:13.179
In that moment, Jogo also says his final farewells
to Dagon and just like that blitzes Nanami,

00:29:13.179 --> 00:29:15.400
igniting the upper half of his body..

00:29:15.400 --> 00:29:20.850
This sadly is where the beginning of the end
for Nanami’s story started…

00:29:20.850 --> 00:29:26.630
After this Jogo and Sukuna went head-to-head
and as Yuji was finally given control of his

00:29:26.630 --> 00:29:30.950
body after the fight, he had an emotional
breakdown after seeing the destruction he

00:29:30.950 --> 00:29:32.669
had caused.

00:29:32.669 --> 00:29:39.549
Probably somewhere nearby below Yuji, Nanami
wakes up in a daze.

00:29:39.549 --> 00:29:44.309
His upper body is completely decimated with
the left half of it being burned to a crisp

00:29:44.309 --> 00:29:46.480
by Jogo’s previous attack.

00:29:46.480 --> 00:29:49.890
Even the entire left side of his face is but
burnt flesh and bone.

00:29:49.890 --> 00:29:56.010
He keeps on walking, pushing forth when suddenly
a swarm of transfigured humans meet him.

00:29:56.010 --> 00:30:01.510
As he does his last stand, slicing and hacking
into every transfigured human that comes towards

00:30:01.510 --> 00:30:06.130
him, he daydreams about Malaysia and the ideal
life he wants to live there.

00:30:06.130 --> 00:30:11.080
He starts to look for Megumi and says that
he’s “just tired” while still fighting

00:30:11.080 --> 00:30:13.120
like it is second nature to him.

00:30:13.120 --> 00:30:17.910
That was until the worst thing that could
happen, came into fruition....

00:30:17.910 --> 00:30:22.630
Mahito appears in front of him, with his hand
placed on his chest.

00:30:22.630 --> 00:30:28.270
The cursed spirit tries to strike up a conversation
with him but Nanami is already at his wits

00:30:28.270 --> 00:30:29.270
limit.

00:30:29.270 --> 00:30:32.820
He hallucinates and talks to his late partner,
Yu Haibara.

00:30:32.820 --> 00:30:37.330
He contemplates why he comes back to being
a sorcerer and as he finishes his question,

00:30:37.330 --> 00:30:40.019
Yu Haibara points at something to his right.

00:30:40.019 --> 00:30:46.440
In that moment, Nanami looked over and saw
Yuji running into his room.

00:30:46.440 --> 00:30:52.320
Ahh this moment always cuts deep, but as you
could imagine, this was the perfect situation

00:30:52.320 --> 00:30:53.830
for Mahito.

00:30:53.830 --> 00:30:59.389
Still fading between life and death, Nanami
says his to best friend, Yu, that he doesn’t

00:30:59.389 --> 00:31:02.710
want to end up cursing Yuji for his fate.

00:31:02.710 --> 00:31:07.649
With that as his final thoughts, Nanami smiles
sincerely at Yuji, the student who meant so

00:31:07.649 --> 00:31:12.389
much to him, and says his final words “You’ve
got it from here”.

00:31:12.389 --> 00:31:16.299
As he finishes that statement, Mahito uses
his cursed technique and destroys Nanami’s

00:31:16.299 --> 00:31:21.460
entire upper body, giving Yuji one of the
most traumatic scenes he would ever see.

00:31:21.460 --> 00:31:25.710
After Nanami’s death, Itadori gets enraged
and is determined to take revenge for his

00:31:25.710 --> 00:31:26.789
fallen mentor.

00:31:26.789 --> 00:31:31.659
Mahito, on the other hand, sends a small transfigured
human at Itadori and transforms it into one

00:31:31.659 --> 00:31:33.840
that can produce spikes from its head!

00:31:33.840 --> 00:31:39.720
Preoccupied by the feeling of rage and revenge,
Itadori gets ready to fight!

00:31:39.720 --> 00:31:47.490
Mahito not only killed Itadori’s mentor
but also his close friend, Junpei.

00:31:47.490 --> 00:31:52.659
So, keeping the people close to his heart
and mind, Yuji becomes determined to finish

00:31:52.659 --> 00:31:54.309
off Mahito.

00:31:54.309 --> 00:31:59.889
Indeed Kento Nanami’s death left a deep
impact on everyone especially Itadori since

00:31:59.889 --> 00:32:02.470
Nanami died right in front of his eyes.

00:32:02.470 --> 00:32:10.270
At first, he couldn’t believe that Nanami
had died, just like most of us.

00:32:10.270 --> 00:32:15.090
But In the end, it resulted in some hardcore
character development for our boy, since he

00:32:15.090 --> 00:32:19.159
felt emotions like “rage” and “hatred”
towards a specific being for the first time

00:32:19.159 --> 00:32:24.230
in his life.

00:32:24.230 --> 00:32:29.100
Yuji lost someone he looked up to, someone
who might have possibly replaced the gap left

00:32:29.100 --> 00:32:30.400
by his grandpa.

00:32:30.400 --> 00:32:33.149
So, it left a scar on his heart.

00:32:33.149 --> 00:32:38.160
From not wanting to kill mutated humans to
wanting to DESTROY all his enemies, Itadori

00:32:38.160 --> 00:32:43.330
changed a lot and Nanami’s death was a catalyst
of what was to come.

00:32:43.330 --> 00:32:47.539
Thank you if you have made it to the end of
the video, if you want me to cover a few more

00:32:47.539 --> 00:32:54.750
of Jujutsu Kaisens characters lives in full,
then make sure to let me know who down below.

00:32:54.750 --> 00:32:58.940
Preferably id do the ones who have passed
on, as that gives me a solid beginning and

00:32:58.940 --> 00:33:02.320
end and I wont have to come back and redo
the characters.

